<h1>Raynetta Greenleaf</h1>
<p>17th Ward alderman, on the Chicago ballot February 23, 2027.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Filed nominating petitions to run for the seat held by Ald. David Moore; on the Chicago Board of Elections candidate list as of Oct. 30, 2026. No campaign website or platform found.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>In her 2019 run for this seat she described herself as a patient care facilitator at Rush University Medical Center and founder of Greenleaf Motivation Inc., a community organization.</p>
